From 49bf9728df0e340b850cfe440533b8176f2e6d6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWCH Phase 4 <phase4@openwch.local>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 07:22:37 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] RISC-V: generate multiply instructions for Zmmul

Model Zmmul as an independent subextension so it enables every integer multiplication pattern without enabling division. Reject a redundant M+Zmmul architecture with the WCH diagnostic, and define the corresponding multiplication feature macros.

Behavior specification: tmp/phase4-evidence/s3-zmmul-official/; tmp/phase4-evidence/s3-gcc-zmmul-final/official.s; tmp/phase4-evidence/s3-zmmul-implementation/official-rv32.s; tmp/phase4-evidence/s3-zmmul-implementation/official-rv64.s; tmp/phase4-evidence/s3-zmmul-implementation/official-conflict.stderr.

gcc/ChangeLog:

	* common/config/riscv/riscv-common.cc (riscv_ext_version_table):
	Add zmmul.
	(riscv_ext_flag_table): Likewise.
	* config/riscv/riscv-c.cc (riscv_cpu_cpp_builtins): Define
	__riscv_mul for Zmmul.
	* config/riscv/riscv-opts.h (MASK_ZMMUL, TARGET_ZMMUL): New macros.
	* config/riscv/riscv.opt (riscv_zmmul_subext): New variable.
	* config/riscv/riscv.cc (riscv_rtx_costs): Use the hardware
	multiply cost for Zmmul.
	(riscv_option_override): Reject M combined with Zmmul.
	* config/riscv/riscv.md (mulsi3, muldi3, mulv<mode>4, umulv<mode>4)
	(*mulsi3_extended, *mulsi3_extended2, <u>mulditi3)
	(<su>muldi3_highpart, usmulditi3, usmuldi3_highpart, <u>mulsidi3)
	(<su>mulsi3_highpart, usmulsidi3, usmulsi3_highpart): Enable for
	Zmmul.

gcc/testsuite/ChangeLog:

	* gcc.target/riscv/wch-zmmul.c: New test.
	* gcc.target/riscv/wch-zmmul-conflict.c: New test.
	* gcc.target/riscv/wch-zmmul-predef.c: New test.
	* gcc.target/riscv/wch-zmmul-rv64.c: New test.
